{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1433,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe6c4b8f0d9a7f7d01000afa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在是顺风。把帆拉满，\r\n宛如大海上呼啸而过的风般出发吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "00ecd1f5eb99136b0bd49f786317c9190125fb971f282243996f4eb634799d07",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1bcce0a2e92510852ac7a488",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家会吹起什么样的风呢？\r\n真令人雀跃……\r\n真想快点亲身体验。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e99a8c9290bf980296e5cd0490379ac71c1fd86dad580b35d2921c82f28ecef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:830d05c7cb08d99d41a9355a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如雄鹿般强劲，\r\n如夏风般轻快，\r\n敬请期待我急驰的脚步声。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f8c9c2de6fc0aa12e0867b2efcf556c1c39a05b6709c2853f6bd51bcf1ccf67",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b40edc02a1155b5354d7512",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夜寐之鸟，溪中之鱼──\r\n嗯，一如往常，非常普通。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e63d2be15d08569805547d7de3b4a643b9b9c2fd6f73f64073e3c0e76b71d06",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6cacb11d500dff3a96f39850",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天的风……很平静。\r\n既不狂野，也不需要害怕。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e25815e17cda25e15556f8e5341a2dd8caf67987bd4df8adcebe8d621c25af6a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7df9f99f61222bc40fa8ffd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我感觉到跟平常一样熟悉的风。\r\n而我也一如往常。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dbffd1daefaab62ba815ac3efa31fc36a569ac64975642aeca67316f6b894f13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49b7a4c74e613076a0893f09",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即使跟平常不一样，\r\n那也是无可奈何。\r\n本来就无法一切都随心所欲。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a5dd39742b2ff7ebf0da01469a001133937e0a471626bcccb9629206e6a331f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19b395670d9c0fa62afa6379",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "吹出现在最强的风吧。\r\n如果内心躁动时也能证明自己，\r\n那我将是真正的疾风。",
      "source_fingerprint": "47ccdd43200134cdf4ca8ae2b30728a097cb376d8572cf72ba8fe429d00759a0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b146e2acb1871b9b268d9ff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没事……只是感觉轻飘飘的……\r\n但上场比赛时……\r\n风儿应该会唤醒我……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ace74c5ec7a30ca092909fdd9ee222ee779a5c035ea7b81133e17de1529b9371",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd1309a008c175cec191c05b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即使落叶被迫受洪流摆布……\r\n也绝对、不会沉没……\r\n落叶，有落叶努力的方式……",
      "source_fingerprint": "4eef37e37784b2fbd3809ef14e2eb5984a73bcbe0929688dc713de5702d24c0a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:729583c184c87bbd1abb9d4d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感觉无论怎么吸气，\r\n都无法呼吸……风和我……\r\n都非常不流畅。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8333898aa8c38c8adda7005ffb725066d82311d8ed678d2f72dbba9daf27c664",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4115299e3d250ae3d4db569c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然刚才在树荫底下休息过了……\r\n不对，现在只能全力以赴了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a8735e052eac5f5cfbca39b9326ade4df2990f8e1f8772a32e4930e9763a0215",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f8227bd3d9cd9450d565207",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开始吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5340d32cafefeb07fb71f273be0d9e41c17a0c3f97ce3ec0784aa70ad39fd299",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:03d0aceed05adf18701750b0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我上场了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad1f9cae30791da93459ed415bd493b478715233c9de670a5777e0bb84856163",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e566c744c9395f915e56d584",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "原来如此……",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d06f5a891ba2624277731a988574bb9f2f48b7bccc320f0c352e6f3e08904e8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef421dd9a684dc7fa637d596",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来学习吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "86d8ede609d4f300283ddd3983ee56e11d2bb193449ea4b621ef99900282211c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab2018683fcd659703fe8cf1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀呀？",
      "source_fingerprint": "22cc90e8d0146ed336d4063cc5057f806ddb58835583200e179f250d8b2ab40f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:03af3f50b7af6cbbaed20b90",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔唔……",
      "source_fingerprint": "1dfb96d163733959e5250b066fab803d16c85e8be2ca2413aca9f44e91be5c0d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:05f813a85c09341706807820",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "与风一同嬉戏……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0bff444a8e55d6f35ca6857c7f5077d4a710a0801886c4a0bcc079ec48976f3a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b94c5a36479015a5b21ca2bc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "海风在呼唤我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c38538c2288bf88151133331b9f2d8a6c8900d293ca8e6e78b795217303e797",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c335bb43675f1e138373d1b1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我让你感觉到了什么样的风呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "89de08cc0db583b59332160e04442179c48168a0eeda0982fd5fd0a9ef669382",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "20049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e0d36e00f768581f122473bd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦你……唤来了风。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2e138f25a8191223b4a53bfbb29c754d3b9fc30c8987298b94e3ee647b058e4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "20050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e5da61529fdb6e109dd5111",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一起成为风吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f39d648cbeff7fa4eac2f3d65403e0719ad0d09a23fee7115a50d88fa7c761e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc47fe5930c5e2e7ab5d474a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "带着风一起……",
      "source_fingerprint": "13f09c1a72a4f48385e1a7d7bb928e85bcbd5cca82e40b5b41270d150700de8f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "2030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ca268b9ccd3a18720776b7f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "各位，一起掀起一阵风吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6d9b358f4b8d271e8a521936544367f1fcf213ffe6bc845020a1b3aa509faf9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "2031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d46d4403a99b9c56bc9ee66d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦你……唤来了风。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2e138f25a8191223b4a53bfbb29c754d3b9fc30c8987298b94e3ee647b058e4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "2032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:356bf5e12ea3867fff240633",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如雄鹿般强劲，\r\n如夏风般轻快，\r\n敬请期待我急驰的脚步声。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f8c9c2de6fc0aa12e0867b2efcf556c1c39a05b6709c2853f6bd51bcf1ccf67",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "2033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94dc5a5baba40ed35add6286",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "脚感觉好轻……呼～\r\n好了，我们出发吧，\r\n去吹起一阵令人难忘的烈风。",
      "source_fingerprint": "252cb172505899416361b25ee6409267866d26c90b3f3933bde2192569ef48a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "2034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9df31cf0ab494bc9b6d98738",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦你……唤来了风。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2e138f25a8191223b4a53bfbb29c754d3b9fc30c8987298b94e3ee647b058e4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "2035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be337a5df489d1c770850e9a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开始吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5340d32cafefeb07fb71f273be0d9e41c17a0c3f97ce3ec0784aa70ad39fd299",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ffc2de937911322b228f968",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还差一点，若能化作疾风的话……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4e414d093356a53d74c043f1d193320d7a95311950cad80bddcd103d42817f9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c8d3acf46b4238d3d095d47",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没能成为烈风啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "46318ba73194efe982ba9d50c76d0f962fd0faf3a713d6c19980501b724daf9e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f04d957e7a6953bcebc0c36",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "比赛总是有输有赢……不过……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "945ce0adffa54f6309f579b91d7d95b81fdaa1f2d67aec85826b41d7be5c9bc5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d596ad2a7f50730360e97531",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "风平浪静……什么都没留下……",
      "source_fingerprint": "18f2bb6d6c4fd566e265594aaa1546ccfe2c5aa711c6f76553c80b6ffeec0f6f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b231ce0c2621d585264ddfc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的风与我的灵魂──\r\n是否吹到你身边了呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2889092b6975cec38b9e11e1658591d246bf25ee31ef0c3a23ea0ffc91e97951",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a82473f19c399a0b742f9ce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "舒服的胜利之风……抚过我的脸颊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4574aadfdab0eefe44d801c40b9421fb11d3382c82e0ea9325ee844b076aaaac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36e5b62ce28f20dcb0e5bb14",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这风儿，我想和你一起品味。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6baa3dd3001f1b871128406987179b6758535b43656b7dbf19e713e519dbc947",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "30006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc76e46efd16502af6cb55b4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "舒服的胜利之风……抚过我的脸颊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4574aadfdab0eefe44d801c40b9421fb11d3382c82e0ea9325ee844b076aaaac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "30007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e339f0dff1d0f0182580adcc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "自由地，鲜明地……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e500ee0d60a579d67fa43c8eaf066e56a30397fc66984a3720b704789d83ee5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b55ffa8ebfc4e7b63adfc2be",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们走吧，化为一阵风……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c036b5984f1fe98135ba9b2e475d856269f4c491c3102f7f7608f60826f00593",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1641681e745e9c5ecef512e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喂哟~哟~切克切克嘣♪\r\n——呵呵。太阳神同学的独特问候\r\n有着令人心儿跃动的韵律呢",
      "source_fingerprint": "d25bb1df77718fb5e5902ef53692179de9c2dbb53319eb53c1e0497248d3afac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "400001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f53808fdc7ff1e28e769240",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想拍一个能感受风的视频，\r\n然后在森林里拍了十小时……\r\n这还能算短吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "353feae312c698f180b00acfc90d99bc018aa6b3fef8821a2125486dd8014991",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "400004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2faf81e5ee8356ca0722161f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "满心期待着他的萌芽与绽放，\r\n不知自己能否为其浇水。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4be4b326d21149c326ddbf2d1d961ed992d09d970e02fd72a9210a02ee1d4029",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "400005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12f21271be77dff1a01565a1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在情人节和粉丝们交换了心意……\r\n温暖的风，这次自己……\r\n将一切连接了起来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e38ac933530dc96bc8cf0c4cf3674aaeaf7c4de30c611963dcacd684fafc5f5a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "400009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:06dbef48995f564be5ac7e4a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "变得更自由、更高、更快。\r\n──然后，我将成为风……",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ae8afe95f9eb22efba01bc358d82d355d36ca8d4b53c638351edb8842edc4c4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f59df3883fbb831910c4c41",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "日和风也是促进开花的惠风呢。\r\n请为花儿带来永远的幸福。",
      "source_fingerprint": "025418979d58406f22b5907a88da0e90f990c01581b7f53f72bb842da53ec614",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "400014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19eecea57e60d2feb0621ca6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这阵风，请好好感受！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ffaf15b8462c758f64ea5a59d151f8e371b2b6abeb386c3f97c707fce6504a4f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "40003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2b3b9b1cbab3a9869fc7d48",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "总有一天会抚摸到那脸庞。\n吹吧……我最重要的，思念之风。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b3cad3fc855b88ac522b2ae84dc74e7e964e8c6b4724bc766431fc648afe5701",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "40004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6cdf2a0a4d5b97a9a3b8b05a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "直播……趋势……同接……\r\n不像清风那样容易呢。\r\n用风来比喻的话，能记住吗……",
      "source_fingerprint": "fae6259bcadfb3cb3f186d1ad26420a6adc3b8a1b27c858512532164f2489b50",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "400100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:885c580c510edc82ad09f306",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一起享受美妙的音色吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a11c1ecaebd2970d145c4b669fbc071bacf6398eb741038e07c04f0716cc6ffe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba5b47c11d5e70e90ace9963",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一起共享短暂的梦境。",
      "source_fingerprint": "87cf480f88e0a4516be2d2507937b38a13b1c3fdc720941806c2e03cc8d4574b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d223409c469a9a26766aa3cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "直到成长为风暴的那天……",
      "source_fingerprint": "6836e5210e702d27101a33762b2f170bf5ac7d5c3e30125222e5d0a38715f8e8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b3be0e6159e1cf9bbf02857",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不仅理解我这道风，\r\n甚至还追了上来……\r\n你就像是一道无与伦比的暖风呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd6a2dfed337c9bb170ead0eb059ecb243c7dd9aad057be2ff5daf266ad9e3f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8e8046a9c02be80e05a6fca",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是传统的证明……\r\n宛如年轮不断迭加的大树一般。",
      "source_fingerprint": "43091598eefc4f3a0213da5805dd80abaa8925b4078344fdcdc7a7df6f67e552",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94172396a18ad0b4dfc4769e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵，这是金鱼的衣服呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "873f0133fa999dc7c43169c49e3eb1e50f6ea6a56d10e5a773623417c9bb19f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5de55274834969901cfe674c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让微风，变得鲜明……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a507f691967776e4d4b5ba1fd65f85f670d09f5decd8fc766eb7d7d17c3b82ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1dee9697ef13c9712eb52047",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家聚在一起，就像山葡萄一样……\r\n呵呵，真可爱。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae84862148bc040ae2535eebefc3452c617a960f6c54db9f3175e8b1c7b1cc23",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1600c2b195de09619b1932a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "演唱会开始前，有人悄悄帮我整理好\r\n衣服。呵呵，大家都如暖风一般呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "63ed3ee864dc1aa2ed633d55533a573b9c0bec56e2b3e15fbf8875dfc2cdc43a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45d8200bcb21eac2c441f778",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "天空的湛蓝配上花朵点缀……\r\n看起来很棒吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3435ecfd6a1640b5f69b2c99dde4f6cc4fe26450cbbbc5026214fa5890288289",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f038f9c5c36a561db405ad65",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会借着疾风为你制作点心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "81d3a01979bf545b95e3fe21a216049eaf90db8ad429fef459f2fff4fed728f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "70016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:113891a3be7c6ad4ba15aaee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这轻柔如棉的光风……我很喜欢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7574cda13e87acc0f95cc5d205159252ed7d21df0076d5133c40d6ef348c473b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "70017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31dd5b8ae2362f585f2b8514",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼哼～♪如何呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f845afbfa64557c621e13c52143eaa0b1a8a2c89d1a100dcda3a757006e5e74a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ae1238e97e098431d48615d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就像树叶会随着季节变换般……\r\n我也更换衣服了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "799c2fc4791bbeb39fb135c81673ffda07d573873d26a3e45d37e889bbde6e7a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85a49d208eeec94b48541803",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼，总归冷静下来了。\r\n我很喜欢浅棕色，这是一种\r\r对眼睛温柔的……向阳处的土壤色。",
      "source_fingerprint": "15de40ae29116a4509f9d5bf2effc254a1fd276507eb97118f7e22898aaf1c0c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56841e83f6e1461252056f59",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "随风而行，出去走走怎么样？\r\n在随性而至之处创造的回忆，\n也是相当不错的呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "91cb2ef5cf52a1d4901d9cee9ea5e2ec7b4e4ee7e097d9074299e982923c750e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34c926e9d15b564c6a641c76",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是传统的证明……\r\n宛如年轮不断迭加的大树一般。",
